    "npcKind": "creature",
    "npcNotes": "<p><strong>Movement:</strong> 3 (Sprint 10)</p><p><strong>Death Grip.</strong> When reduced to 0 Health it removes half the damage, takes –1D and may make two attacks per round.</p><p><strong>Vulnerable to Fire.</strong> Fire attacks gain an extra degree; fire damage equal to its Health destroys it.</p><p><strong>Wight Template.</strong> Created from a slain human (see the book for the full transformation rules).</p><p><em>Statistics: Agility 1, Athletics 3, Cunning 1, Endurance 3, Fighting 2, Language 0, Stealth 4. SIFRP p. 223.</em></p>",
    "source": "SIFRP p. 223"
